			"notes": "First multiloader release for Minecraft 1.21.1.\n\n### Added\n- Native builds for Fabric, NeoForge and Forge from one codebase, with the\n  same mod version on every loader.\n- Block break/place, explosion, container, sign, entity interaction, death and\n  login/logout logging to SQLite (default) or MySQL/MariaDB.\n- `/ag inspect` wand, `/ag lookup` with filters and pagination, area selection,\n  `/ag rollback` / restore, `/ag prune`, `/ag export` and `/ag status`.\n- Public `AquaGuardAPI` for other mods to write custom log entries.\n\n### Changed\n- Removed the runtime dependency on Architectury API. AquaGuard no longer\n  requires any library mod besides Fabric API on Fabric.\n- AquaGuard is server-side only on Forge and NeoForge: players can join without\n  installing it."
		}
